What Are Baseball Trading Cards?
Baseball trading cards are collectible cards typically made of cardboard or thick paper featuring player images, statistics, and team information. Once simple promotional items, they've evolved into high-value assets blending sports nostalgia with serious investment potential. Modern cards now incorporate cutting-edge features like digital authentication and blockchain-based NFTs, creating new dimensions in collector markets.

